ght:400;line-height:120%">Each of the nominees for election as director listed in Cybin&#8217;s management information circular dated July 24, 2024 were elected as directors of Cybin for the ensuing year or until their successors are elected or appointed. Voting results are set out below&#58;</font></div><div style="padding-left:10.62pt;padding-right:10.62pt;text-align:center"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:91.346%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:20.478%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:18.900%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:14.689%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:20.829%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:19.604%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#f2f2f2;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;padding:0 1pt"></td><td colspan="6" style="background-color:#f2f2f2;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;padding:2px 19pt;text-align:center;text-indent:-36pt;vertical-align:middle"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:700;line-height:100%">Votes For</font></td><td colspan="6" style="background-color:#f2f2f2;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;padding:2px 19pt;text-align:center;text-indent:-36pt;vertical-align:middle"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:700;line-height:100%">Votes Withheld</font></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#f2f2f2;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;padding:0 1pt"></td><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#f2f2f2;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;border-top:0.